a1800 codec: modified copy of https://github.com/John-K/a1800_codec (Apache-2.0)
Original: Copyright John-K and contributors.

Modifications by furby-fi (2026):
  src/encoder.rs
    - Quantisation now uses the analysis-filter scale_param instead of the one
      recomputed from the gain indices (decoder_sp). The subband samples are scaled
      by the analysis value, so using decoder_sp mis-scaled the quantiser.
    - frame_param is chosen from actual Huffman bit counts (smallest value that
      fits the frame budget) instead of the BIT_ALLOC_COST estimate.
    The previous behaviour can be selected with A18_SP=decoder A18_RC=estimate.
  See furby-fi-encoder-fix.diff.

